<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 13.117 Retro-Bucky</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Strickland, Robert W: North York FG Newsletter, Sep 96</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Based on Buckminser-Fuller's geodesic sphere. Pavilion</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">uses retroreflector principle, but angle is less.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">60 facets + 15 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">3-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.009</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374"> H/W = 0.806</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.282</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="410">pc13117.asc</tspan>
</text>
